              "# Why Should We Care About China’s GDP Growth?\n## The politics behind China’s GDP growth\nIn 2019, for example, Q1 growth of 6.4 percent and Q2 growth of 6.2 percent put the government on track to meet its target of 6-6.5 percent. That means new government spending to boost growth might be unlikely for Q3, but could be on the cards later in the year if quarterly growth falls below six percent"
